@startuml UC16_ChallengeTrainer_Activity
title UC16 - Challenge Trainer (Activity Diagram)
note
  **Under Development** — Trainer challenge uses
  StoryService.TryChallengeTrainer() but no
  dedicated Trainer screen is implemented yet.
end note

start
:Player encounters Trainer NPC in StoryScreen;
:StoryScreen.HandleTalk(npc) displays trainer dialogue;

note right: npc.Action == "StartBattle"

:StoryScreen calls StoryService.TryChallengeTrainer(npc);
:StoryService checks Player.PokemonTeam alive;

if (Team has alive Pokemon?) then (yes)
  :PokemonSpawner generates trainer team;
  :Set GameSession.CurrentEnemyTeam;
  :Set GameSession.IsTrainerBattle = true;
  :ScreenManager switches to BattleScreen;
  
  note right
    Battle executes per UC2 flow.
    BattleService handles turn logic.
    On victory: ExpService processes rewards.
  end note
  
  if (Player won?) then (yes)
    :ExpService awards experience;
    :Display victory message;
  else (no)
    :Display defeat message;
    :Return to StoryScreen;
  endif
  
else (no)
  :Display "Heal your Pokemon first!";
endif

stop
@enduml
